m=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e8cfee1a7b78ff5d15f2ee66c099e91 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5a72ec4f/uploads/origins/e3b8db22-a9fe-48df-9c0b-efc4f0937b7c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=354e12caa0afd4845fa1e74a46e16dec 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I would love to request my vtuber character if you are willing to draw! I saw your recent delivery of my friend and I love your style very much!\n\nShe is an energetic postal delivery girl! She comes from an adventure guild in an RPG style game who delivers quests to various adventurers! She is clumsy and kind of forgetful, but is always trying her best.\n\nI would love to leave the details of the pose and composition to you! Feel free to draw whatever you find pleasing but I would love if the pose is dynamic and upbeat! \n\nThank you very much for your consideration!\n\nRef Sheet: https://www.dropbox.com/s/xxdv9pq0h6l0br0/stellia_sheet_full.jpg?dl=0\nMore references: https://imgur.com/a/2lGhsc2", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@mee_55551/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2639176, "client_id": 1376011, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e8f24261/uploads/origins/7d219dbc-1603-4da4-ade4-48f1079cf864?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85e56ea07da4b5e5aa3a44bc27113a39", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e8f24261/uploads/origins/7d219dbc-1603-4da4-ade4-48f1079cf864?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85e56ea07da4b5e5aa3a44bc27113a39, https://si.imgix.net/e8f24261/uploads/origins/7d219dbc-1603-4da4-ade4-48f1079cf864?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebfa8799641ade76e993254a0e5aa4f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e8f24261/uploads/origins/7d219dbc-1603-4da4-ade4-48f1079cf